# BAWAAL War Cry · Vault · Hub · Burst (LOCKED)

Production-final snapshot. Do **not** restyle, reorder, or rewire unless the user explicitly unlocks this rule.

## 1. Custom skull vault registry

There is **no** root `vaultAssets.js`. Canonical skull map:

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| [`src/constants/skullEmojiRegistry.js`](src/constants/skullEmojiRegistry.js) | Every `assets/skull_*.png` → explicit `require()` in `SKULL_EMOJIS` |
| [`scripts/generateSkullEmojiRegistry.js`](scripts/generateSkullEmojiRegistry.js) | Regenerator — run after adding skull PNGs |
| [`src/constants/bawaalEmojiAssets.js`](src/constants/bawaalEmojiAssets.js) | Merges `...SKULL_EMOJIS` into `BAWAAL_EMOJI_ASSETS`; `ALL_SKELETON_KEYS` includes `SKULL_EMOJI_KEYS` |

**Contract:** filenames are keys (e.g. `skull_hattrick`). Registry count must match `assets/skull_*.png` (189 as of lock-in). Vault picker + `FloatingEmojiBurst` resolve via `BawaalEmoji` / registry keys only — never unicode.

## 2. ChallengerArena / War Cry 1v1

| Surface | Locked path |
|---|---|
| Product module | [`WarCryScreen.js`](WarCryScreen.js) → re-exports [`Live1v1BattleScreen.js`](Live1v1BattleScreen.js) |
| Routes | `Live1v1Battle` + `ChallengerArena` in [`App.js`](App.js) mount `WarCryScreen` |

### Layout
- Dual Host / Rival panes: `hostHalf` / `rivalHalf` — `flex: 1`, `minHeight: 0`, `PANEL_HOST` / `PANEL_RIVAL`
- Central VS: `vsAbsoluteCenter` + `vsBadge` (44px; transform ±22)
- Athlete header: `athleteTopBack` — BAWAAL left, `QUEUED (N)` right; pane chrome clears via `ATHLETE_TOP_BAR_H`
- Inactive RTC: `StreamFallbackPanel` (flag + handle + STANDBY / RECONNECTING)

### 5-hour registration cutoff
Source: [`src/utils/warCrySchedule.js`](src/utils/warCrySchedule.js)

- Rule: `now >= start_time - 5h` → closed (`WAR_CRY_REGISTRATION_CUTOFF_MS`)
- Badge: `REGISTRATIONS CLOSED – WAR ROOM LOCKED` (`warCryRegistrationBadge` / `getWarCryRegistrationState`)
- Enforce disable: Battles ACCEPT / join CTAs, roster CALL OUT, CreateBattleSheet rival input when closed

