## 4. Reaction particle burst

Canonical: [`src/components/FloatingEmojiBurst.js`](src/components/FloatingEmojiBurst.js)

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| Layer | `StyleSheet.absoluteFillObject` over video / stadium card |
| Spawn | `BURST_CENTER_Y_RATIO = 0.75` (lower-center of measured bounds) |
| Duration | `BURST_DURATION_MS = 2800` |
| Cleanup | `BURST_CLEANUP_MS = 3000` (must not unmount early) |
| Opacity | Solid through ~75%, fade in last quarter |
| Motion | Brief downward kick → upward float (`BURST_FLOAT_Y` negative) |

Wired on Arena reel/challenge cards ([`ArenaFeed.js`](ArenaFeed.js)) and War Cry ([`Live1v1BattleScreen.js`](Live1v1BattleScreen.js)) via `FloatingEmojiBurstLayer` + `createCenteredEmojiBurst`.

